&lt;h4 class=&quot;TokenisedTypography-module__EzGiEkH0__v6-3-8 TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7&quot;&gt;Your Profile&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or state-certified technician in electrical engineering, mechatronics, automation technology, or comparable qualifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3–5 years of professional experience in customer support and field service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in robotics and automation technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of high-level programming languages (e.g., ROS), experience with SAP, and Linux operating systems is desirable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel internationally up to 60% of the time, primarily within Europe and North America&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Class B driver’s license / internationally valid driver’s license&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in spoken and written German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and assertiveness skills, as well as intercultural competence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
